      "section": "Pick a gene",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "The card on the right opens on GENE072, the strongest up-regulated gene, and shows its whole row: identity, location, test result, variant load and pathway, with the Ensembl and UniProt identifiers as links. Click a gene in the scatter (fold change against mean expression) to swap the card to it; a box or lasso selection stacks one card per gene, and clearing the selection returns to the default. The row is a gene-level summary of the kind nf-core/rnaseq and nf-core/differentialabundance results give once joined to the annotation.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/advanced_viz_demo"
    },
